  "beats": [
    {
      "t": "2026-11-18T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "The Israeli army has launched its first operation in central Gaza Strip, with families displaced from the area, the first such operation since the ceasefire agreement signed in October 2025 came into effect.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-18:6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-18T00:00:08Z",
      "text": "On 18 November, the IDF began a ground operation west of the Yellow Line, which it said targeted a tunnel posing a threat to troops, advancing tanks onto Salah al-Din Road near the Nuseirat and Bureij refugee camps.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1386582023:281"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-18T00:00:15Z",
      "text": "The Gaza war is an armed conflict in the Gaza Strip and Israel, fought as part of the unresolved Israeli–Palestinian and Gaza–Israel conflicts.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1386582023:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-18T00:00:25Z",
      "text": "On the map, the reports place the operation in the Gaza Strip.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-18:6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-18T00:00:33Z",
      "text": "The reports also name Levant.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-18:6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-18T00:00:42Z",
      "text": "The story was reported by BBC News.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-18:6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-18T00:00:50Z",
      "text": "Al Jazeera headlined it: “Israeli forces launch new military operation in central Gaza.”",
      "cites": [
        "news:aljazeera:bd982f0d6d88"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-18T00:00:56Z",
      "text": "DW headlined it: “Israel launches new ground operation in Gaza.”",
      "cites": [
        "news:dw:35417a49cd93"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-18T00:01:02Z",
      "text": "France 24 headlined it: “Israeli army launches ground operation in Hamas-controlled area of Gaza.”",
      "cites": [
        "news:france24:842ad9ad2dc7"
